<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Plants Cause Disease</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; margin: 2rem 4rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; }
        h1 { color: #2c5530; }
        .intro { max-width: 60em; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .disease-list { column-width: 18em; column-gap: 2rem; }
        .disease-list a { display: block; padding: 0.2rem 0; text-decoration: none; color: #2c5530; }
        .disease-list a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        footer { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Plants Cause Disease</h1>
<p class="intro">
    All the diseases listed below are either directly caused by or worsened by plant consumption. If you are currently
    suffering from any of the diseases, or you wish to avoid getting these diseases, you should seriously consider no
    longer consuming plants.
</p>
<div class="disease-list">
{% for disease in diseases %}
<a href="/disease/{{ disease.uri }}.html">{{ disease.name }}</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<footer>Plants Cause Disease</footer>
</body>
</html>
